Input: {"question": "Which sports team does Sergei Bespalykh represent or represent?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 183, "text": "As the sun dipped below the horizon, casting a warm orange glow over the Auburn University campus, a peculiar sight caught the attention of students hurrying to their evening classes."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 184, "end": 293, "text": "On the outdoor basketball court, a lone figure was running drills, his movements a blur of speed and agility."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 294, "end": 418, "text": "His jet-black hair was slicked back, revealing a sharp jawline and piercing blue eyes that seemed to bore into the pavement."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 419, "end": 530, "text": "This was no ordinary college student, but Sergei Bespalykh, the Russian footballer turned basketball sensation."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 531, "end": 646, "text": "Rumors had been circulating about Bespalykh's sudden interest in hoops, and now, it seemed, the whispers were true."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 647, "end": 764, "text": "The 6'2\" athlete, known for his lightning-quick reflexes on the soccer pitch, was trading in his cleats for sneakers."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 765, "end": 933, "text": "As he sprinted down the court, his powerful legs eating up the distance, it was clear that his football-honed skills were translating surprisingly well to the hardwood."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 934, "end": 1046, "text": "Coach Bruce Pearl, a keen observer of talent, watched from the sidelines, a hint of a smile playing on his lips."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1047, "end": 1221, "text": "He had taken a chance on Bespalykh, convinced that the Russian's athleticism and competitive drive would make him a valuable asset to the Auburn Tigers men's basketball team."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1222, "end": 1342, "text": "Now, as he witnessed Bespalykh's fluid jump shot and razor-sharp cuts to the basket, he knew he had made the right call."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1343, "end": 1424, "text": "As the evening wore on, a small crowd began to gather, drawn in by the commotion."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1425, "end": 1555, "text": "Among them was Samir Davenport, the team's star point guard, who couldn't help but feel a twinge of curiosity about this newcomer."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1556, "end": 1706, "text": "He had heard the whispers, too – about Bespalykh's unorthodox training methods, his intense focus, and his uncanny ability to adapt to new situations."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1707, "end": 1854, "text": "As he watched Bespalykh sink shot after shot, Davenport couldn't help but wonder: what other secrets did this enigmatic Russian have up his sleeve?"}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1855, "end": 2001, "text": "The answer, it seemed, would have to wait until the season opener, when Bespalykh would don the Auburn Tigers' orange and blue for the first time."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 69, "text": "Title: The Unlikely Hero of FC Volga Tver: Sergei Bespalykh's Journey"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 71, "end": 157, "text": "In the quaint Russian city of Tver, nestled between the Volga River and the Moscow-St."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 158, "end": 203, "text": "Petersburg highway, a football club was born."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 204, "end": 304, "text": "FC Volga Tver, founded in 1959, had seen its fair share of triumphs and tribulations over the years."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 305, "end": 484, "text": "But amidst the ebbs and flows of the team's history, one player stood out - Sergei Bespalykh, a talented Russian footballer who would become an integral part of the club's fabric."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 485, "end": 549, "text": "Sergei's journey to FC Volga Tver was not a straightforward one."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 550, "end": 673, "text": "Born and raised in Tver, he grew up with a passion for football, honing his skills on the streets and in local youth clubs."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 674, "end": 816, "text": "As he entered his teenage years, Sergei's talent became apparent, and he began to attract attention from scouts and coaches across the region."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 817, "end": 910, "text": "In 2010, Sergei took a significant step in his career, joining FC Volga Tver's youth academy."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 911, "end": 1069, "text": "The academy, known for its rigorous training programs and emphasis on developing young talent, provided Sergei with the perfect platform to refine his skills."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1070, "end": 1192, "text": "Under the watchful eyes of experienced coaches, he worked tirelessly to improve his game, and his hard work soon paid off."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1193, "end": 1351, "text": "On a crisp autumn evening in 2012, Sergei made his professional debut for FC Volga Tver in a Russian Football National League match against FC Torpedo Moscow."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1352, "end": 1495, "text": "The 19-year-old midfielder's impressive performance did not go unnoticed, and he quickly established himself as a regular starter for the team."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1496, "end": 1583, "text": "As the seasons passed, Sergei became an indispensable part of FC Volga Tver's midfield."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1584, "end": 1713, "text": "His vision, passing range, and work rate made him a favorite among the fans, who affectionately nicknamed him \"The Tver Tornado.\""}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1714, "end": 1839, "text": "His performances did not go unnoticed by the Russian football fraternity, and he soon attracted interest from top-tier clubs."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1840, "end": 1903, "text": "However, Sergei's loyalty to FC Volga Tver remained unwavering."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1904, "end": 2074, "text": "He continued to don the club's colors, leading the team to several notable victories and earning himself a reputation as one of the most consistent players in the league."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2075, "end": 2225, "text": "In the 2018-2019 season, Sergei's contributions were instrumental in FC Volga Tver's promotion to the Russian Football National League's top division."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2226, "end": 2346, "text": "His goal in the decisive match against FC Chertanovo Moscow will be etched in the memories of the Tver faithful forever."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Sergei Bespalykh", "scope": "sports team", "claim": "Sergei Bespalykh represents the Auburn Tigers men's basketball team.", "answer": "Auburn Tigers", "quote": "He had taken a chance on Bespalykh, convinced that the Russian's athleticism and competitive drive would make him a valuable asset to the Auburn Tigers men's basketball team.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Sergei Bespalykh", "scope": "sports team", "claim": "Sergei Bespalykh represents FC Volga Tver.", "answer": "FC Volga Tver", "quote": "But amidst the ebbs and flows of the team's history, one player stood out - Sergei Bespalykh, a talented Russian footballer who would become an integral part of the club's fabric. Sergei's journey to FC Volga Tver was not a straightforward one. Born and raised in Tver, he grew up with a passion for football, honing his skills on the streets and in local youth clubs. As he entered his teenage years, Sergei's talent became apparent, and he began to attract attention from scouts and coaches across the region. In 2010, Sergei took a significant step in his career, joining FC Volga Tver's youth academy. The academy, known for its rigorous training programs and emphasis on developing young talent, provided Sergei with the perfect platform to refine his skills. Under the watchful eyes of experienced coaches, he worked tirelessly to improve his game, and his hard work soon paid off. On a crisp autumn evening in 2012, Sergei made his professional debut for FC Volga Tver in a Russian Football National League match against FC Torpedo Moscow. The 19-year-old midfielder's impressive performance did not go unnoticed, and he quickly established himself as a regular starter for the team. As the seasons passed, Sergei became an indispensable part of FC Volga Tver's midfield. His vision, passing range, and work rate made him a favorite among the fans, who affectionately nicknamed him \"The Tver Tornado.\" His performances did not go unnoticed by the Russian football fraternity, and he soon attracted interest from top-tier clubs. However, Sergei's loyalty to FC Volga Tver remained unwavering. He continued to don the club's colors, leading the team to several notable victories and earning himself a reputation as one of the most consistent players in the league.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Auburn Tigers", "FC Volga Tver"], "candidate_answers": [{"cand